 "change": "OriginalApplicationStartupInputs.Bitmap.init reads its header fields from the DIB bytes (little-endian) instead of through an OriginalStateRecord over the whole file with a definedness byte per file byte, and validates the image with OriginalDIBPixels.validate, which runs the decoder's checks in the decoder's order and throws its errors without building the decoded colour and definedness arrays: a 24-bit image cannot fail after its extent check, 4/8-bit images check each pixel's palette index as the decoder reads it, RLE8 images decode. L3 review follow-ups: an arena entry whose facts or size are not as declared is not read on the worker threads; in manifest order it takes the old read-and-guard path, so its own errors (including a read's permission error) are unchanged; tests in which the earlier failure comes later in time.",
 "profile": "A12 ml-p0-loadprof: Bitmap.init 8.8% of the load (StateRecord over the file 5.4%, Flat.make 4%, the throwaway decode 3.9%); after L3 it runs on all cores",
